Design work for this client has included:

- Daily teamwork with the developers, content strategist, and product owner.
- Visual identity development.
- UI library maintenance.
- Development of navigation and user journeys.
- Ideation and conceptualization of new features, such as searching for electric cars with the car finder.
- Heatmap monitoring.
- A/B testing.
- Content review and structuring.
- Customer journey visualization.
- Visual design of customer communications (thank-you messages, newsletters, booking confirmations, etc.) and content sparring with the content strategist.

Throughout the development work, we have continuously kept the following in focus:

- Accessibility
- Customer journeys
